Package: bande-avd-firmware
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Section: non-free-firmware
Priority: optional
Description: Firmware for the Apple video decoder of the Mac mini M2
 The open firmware of the coprocessor in front of the M2's video decode
 engines, from AsahiLinux/avd-fw. The kernel's avd driver loads it.
